'''Qymaja Gelis''' ([[Sukatic script]]: Ⱒⰺⰿⰰⱜⰰ Ⰳⰵⰾⰹⱄ; literally ''Qymish Rail'') or simply '''QG''' ([[Sukatic script]]: ⰢⰃ) is a [[wikipedia:crown corporation|crown corporation]] and the national railway company of [[Qym]]. Founded in {{abbr|2211|1836.7 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, it operates and has a monopoly on all rail transport in [[Qym]], whether freight or passenger. It is also responsible for [[wikipedia:Railway infrastructure manager|railway infrastructure management]] and is also active in property management and the hospitality industry. Qym has the [[List of countries on Basis by rail usage|?th-highest railway usage on Basis]], with a modal share of 24.72% for passengers (excluding light rail & metro), and a modal share of 72.86% for freight. 

