===Property management===
Qymaja Gelis tries to develop suitable sites in relation to their railway network and new projects, including stations themselves. U/C

===Shopping centers===
Many railway stations in large cities incorporate shopping centers or are adjacent to ones owned by Qymaja Gelis. U/C

===Hospitality===
Similar to how airports tend to have hotels within or near them, Qym's railways stations often incorporate [[QG Hotels|QG-branded hotels]]. 

